# The collector image is built from the repository root (see
# docker-compose.yml, service python). Keep the build context to what the
# image copies: pyapp/gateshift, sql and webui/VERSION. Everything else is
# excluded, the webapp's own context is ./webui and has its own ignore.
*
!pyapp/gateshift/**
!sql/**
!webui/VERSION
pyapp/gateshift/__pycache__
pyapp/gateshift/**/__pycache__
pyapp/gateshift/tests
sql/**/*.disabled
